  "abstract": "Re-run best LN-SSM to export parameter statistics at completion (U/V norms, U coherence, V-orthogonality, gamma and S gate profiles) into storage for qualitative analysis. Loss is MAE+curvature (\u03bb=1e-4) with V-OrthoReg (\u03bb=1e-5).",
